@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

state Initial
state AddGoods
state UpdatePrice
state RemoveGoods
state OrderPlacement
state GenerateInvoice
state SearchItems
state CalculateDiscountsTaxes
state GenerateReceipt
state ReplaceOrCancel
state SummaryReport

Initial: entry/Start the system
Initial: do/System initialized

Initial --> AddGoods : add new goods
Initial --> UpdatePrice : update price
Initial --> RemoveGoods : remove goods
Initial --> OrderPlacement : place order
Initial --> SearchItems : search items for purchase
Initial --> CalculateDiscountsTaxes : calculate discount and tax
Initial --> GenerateReceipt : generate receipt
Initial --> SummaryReport : view transaction summary

AddGoods: entry/Add new goods
AddGoods: do/Record new item details
AddGoods: exit/Item added successfully

UpdatePrice: entry/Update existing item price
UpdatePrice: do/Edit price information
UpdatePrice: exit/Price updated successfully

RemoveGoods: entry/Remove unwanted items
RemoveGoods: do/Delete selected items
RemoveGoods: exit/Items removed successfully

OrderPlacement: entry/Place order to supplier
OrderPlacement: do/Send order request
OrderPlacement: exit/Order placed successfully

GenerateInvoice: entry/Generate invoice for order
GenerateInvoice: do/Create and save invoice
GenerateInvoice: exit/Invoice generated successfully

SearchItems: entry/Search available items
SearchItems: do/Display search results
SearchItems: exit/Search completed

CalculateDiscountsTaxes: entry/Calculate applicable discount and tax
CalculateDiscountsTaxes: do/Compute totals
CalculateDiscountsTaxes: exit/Calculations done

GenerateReceipt: entry/Generate customer
@enduml
